"""A minimal project consuming rinx as a dependency.

rinx's own examples build it as the *root* module, which hides everything that
only goes wrong across a module boundary: root-only toolchain registration, a
flag set in rinx's `.bazelrc`, a label resolved against the wrong repository.
This module builds a small site the way a user's project would, and is the test
module the Bazel Central Registry's presubmit runs.
"""

module(name = "rinx_smoke")

bazel_dep(name = "rinx")
local_path_override(
    module_name = "rinx",
    path = "../..",
)
